    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/c4e2ef4d8098a840e636e265c571c921.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>repare to unleash your inner avian fury in <strong>Birdoo</strong>, an exhilarating indie action game that casts you as a feathered avenger. Tired of the indignities, the shooing, and being dismissed as a mere &quot;flying rat,&quot; you embark on a relentless quest for payback against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into diverse and vibrant levels, each offering a unique battleground for your revenge. Your mission is simple yet challenging: defeat as many enemies as possible before the clock runs out. Every vanquished foe contributes to your score, propelling you closer to advancing to the next stage. As you progress, accumulate points to unlock an array of powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/b9224396fd6bdb6cb162d9a1f382749c.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through a <strong>dozen varied stages</strong>, each presenting you with distinct challenges. From bustling cityscapes, tranquil hiking paths, all the way to outer space every level demands a fresh approach to your aerial assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/271606b1fe4d72ee78f41e6983d1641b.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover and grab an arsenal of <strong>power-ups</strong> throughout the levels. Unleash devastating attacks, enhance your speed, or gain temporary invincibility to amplify your path of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/4e64e074be4ea9f6c9dbddfd470e6c50.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your points aren't just for bragging rights. Use them to <strong>unlock upgrades</strong>, enhancing your bird's weapon capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/cff3f9d9925ad7b0e3b77f1a23ea58d9.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare to face a <strong>diverse cast of adversaries</strong>, with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. From the unsuspecting pedestrian to the aggressive exterminator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/517df7851f210a1e6d61b18aae9d1150.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete against friends on a local <strong>leaderboard</strong> to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the leaderboard and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathered avenger</strong>, an unstoppable force of nature; your vengeance will be swift and absolute!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/c4e2ef4d8098a840e636e265c571c921.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>repare to unleash your inner avian fury in <strong>Birdoo</strong>, an exhilarating indie action game that casts you as a feathered avenger. Tired of the indignities, the shooing, and being dismissed as a mere &quot;flying rat,&quot; you embark on a relentless quest for payback against humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into diverse and vibrant levels, each offering a unique battleground for your revenge. Your mission is simple yet challenging: defeat as many enemies as possible before the clock runs out. Every vanquished foe contributes to your score, propelling you closer to advancing to the next stage. As you progress, accumulate points to unlock an array of powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/b9224396fd6bdb6cb162d9a1f382749c.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through a <strong>dozen varied stages</strong>, each presenting you with distinct challenges. From bustling cityscapes, tranquil hiking paths, all the way to outer space every level demands a fresh approach to your aerial assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/271606b1fe4d72ee78f41e6983d1641b.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover and grab an arsenal of <strong>power-ups</strong> throughout the levels. Unleash devastating attacks, enhance your speed, or gain temporary invincibility to amplify your path of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/4e64e074be4ea9f6c9dbddfd470e6c50.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your points aren't just for bragging rights. Use them to <strong>unlock upgrades</strong>, enhancing your bird's weapon capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/cff3f9d9925ad7b0e3b77f1a23ea58d9.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare to face a <strong>diverse cast of adversaries</strong>, with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. From the unsuspecting pedestrian to the aggressive exterminator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/517df7851f210a1e6d61b18aae9d1150.avif?t=1755392987\" width=920 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete against friends on a local <strong>leaderboard</strong> to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the leaderboard and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathered avenger</strong>, an unstoppable force of nature; your vengeance will be swift and absolute!</p>",
    "short_description": "Birdoo: Feathered Fury is an indie action game were you assume the role of a bird embarking on a quest for revenge against the humans who wronged him. No longer will you tolerate being called a &quot;flying rat&quot; or being shooed away. It's time to exact your revenge!",
